  "solution": "**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/cd5ffb6543569afb517f1773edbf0c42705773d0409f91a9a2835ca980048bc4.png] \n\n**Given equation:** 18 * 3 * 20 * 5 * 14 = 44\n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n1. ×, +, ÷, −\n\nGiven equation: 18 * 3 * 20 * 5 * 14 = 44\n\nAfter replacing the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 18 × 3 + __**20 ÷ 5**__ − 14 = 44\n\n⇒ __**18 × 3**__ + 4 − 14 = 44\n\n⇒ __**54 + 4**__ − 14 = 44\n\n⇒ __**58 − 14**__ = 44\n\n⇒ 44 = 44\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\n2. ÷, +, −, ×\n\nGiven equation: 18 * 3 * 20 * 5 * 14 = 44\n\nAfter replacing the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**18 ÷ 3**__ + 20 − 5 × 14 = 44\n\n⇒ 6 + 20 − __**5 × 14**__ = 44\n\n⇒ __**6 + 20**__ − 70 = 44\n\n⇒ __**26 − 70**__ = 44\n\n⇒ −44 ≠ 44\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n3. ×, ÷, −, +\n\nGiven equation: 18 * 3 * 20 * 5 * 14 = 44\n\nAfter replacing the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 18 × __**3 ÷ 20**__ − 5 + 14 = 44\n\n⇒ __**18 × 0.15**__ − 5 + 14 = 44\n\n ⇒ **__2.7 + 14__** − 5 = 44\n\n⇒ __**16.7 − 5**__ = 44\n\n⇒ 11.7 ≠ 44\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n4. +, ÷, ×, −\n\nGiven equation: 18 * 3 * 20 * 5 * 14 = 44\n\nAfter replacing the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 18 + __**3 ÷ 20**__ × 5 − 14 = 44\n\n⇒ 18 + __**0.15 × 5**__ − 14 = 44\n\n⇒ __**18 + 0.75**__ − 14 = 44\n\n⇒ __**18.75 − 14**__ = 44\n\n⇒ 4.75 ≠ 44\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**Option 1**\".",
